7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]notifications announce nothing on every machine, and kellys_mbp [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]announces with a sound file instead of the bell.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]notification_delivery_rules.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/notification_delivery_rules.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-14d[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-14d/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rule matcher in the Rust core[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-rules[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-rules: add notification delivery rule wire types, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]first-match-per-field resolver, a case-insensitive glob matcher, and the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]batched resolve_notification_deliveries PyO3 binding to sase-core, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reusing tab_key_for for the tab criterion.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Config surface and Python facade[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]config-rules[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-rules[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config-rules: ratchet the pinned core revision, add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace.notification_rules to default_config.yml and the JSON schema, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add the token-cached Python facade that reads the rules and resolves [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deliveries through the new binding.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Sound file playback[/bold #D7AFFF]                                           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]sound-backend[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sound-backend: add a presentation-side sound module that resolves a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]platform audio player (afplay on macOS; paplay, aplay, then ffplay on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Linux) and plays a file without ever raising into the event loop.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Apply rules in the notification poll[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tui-delivery[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-rules, config-rules, sound-backend[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui-delivery: resolve each arriving notification's delivery on the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]existing worker hop, filter toast-suppressed rows out before batching, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and play at most one resolved sound per poll tick in place of the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unconditional tmux bell.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase notify rules, doctor check, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]observability[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config-rules, sound-backend, tui-delivery[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]observability: add the sase notify rules subcommand with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-notification explanation, a config.notification_rules doctor check, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the notifications docs section describing matching, resolution, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]playback.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The two requested configurations[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]chezmoi-config[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config-rules, observability[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chezmoi-config: add the global task-bead suppression rule to sase.yml [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the sound-file rule to sase_kellys_mbp.yml in the chezmoi repo, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]after confirming the shipping build understands the key.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-14d","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-14d.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a1490bf7e8e352a9c8fab579ec401b6b","started_at":"2026-09-20T17:14:50.093471+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1789925337,"sha":"15763853b338ad6e43b2610d4866e5aec67ec237","subject":"feat(tui): add sound-file playback for notification delivery"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"bf1d0c05d6e5cbb212770b872170dced8c7d5718420ad0f1f46b796f639b458d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-14d.3/chat.md","size_bytes":3358},"commits":{"digest":"4e1a4d12579e92b325c1b157e047f7c82908b22f0b1e79eb5b60b425b7c160da","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-14d.3/commits.json","size_bytes":238},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-14d.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"45a4b05db885a138ec583dc83c921d9eca7d68e7b916669069418955e4901c3c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-14d.3/meta.json","size_bytes":638},"prompt":{"digest":"4c0f9fc9e446d605b510be1d0928cba42d4faf0a577071366cbd3f5033d7be91","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-14d.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":111},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"796714a5b9770f94fb01cd8bf6695af49cf06cd5488e5cda8ce26c313e0bc342","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-14d.3/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":7540},"state":{"digest":"e7c0fcc747b3b5396123aa283c7cc79d759309a81a8e35062eb191eac6d4851e","path":"age